# WP12: LuckPerms and BlueMap are installed and answer. There is no `/ttl ... expect` for them (they are not a
# ttl system), so this checks that every command parses (a failing command fails the test) and prints the state
# for the log. Apply pack/config/luckperms/ttl-groups.txt first (docs/server.md "Permissions (LuckPerms)").
# Read the output: `lp group list` shows default, linked, modder, staff; the three permission checks print
# "true" for staff and "undefined" for default; `bluemap` shows the maps tensura and mortal_realm (or the
# "accept-download" notice while that owner decision is still false).
lp group list
lp group staff info
lp group staff permission check minecraft.command.ban
lp group modder permission check minecraft.command.gamemode
lp group default permission check minecraft.command.ban
bluemap
